{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-copy-image-video-gen","title":"AI 文案/图/视频批量生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-creative-dam-aigc-production/aigc-creative-production/ai-copy-image-video-gen","wordCount":2467,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"ai-文案-图-视频批量生成\">AI 文案/图/视频批量生成</h1><p>一次大促的创意需求可以展开成几千个生成请求：每个市场、每个渠道位置、每套卖点组合都需要文案与画面。把这件事做成&quot;多开几个浏览器窗口手动点&quot;是不可持续的，做成&quot;写个脚本循环调用 API&quot;同样不可持续——后者缺的不是代码，而是幂等键、失败语义、成本核算与溯源链。这一节给出批量生成作为一条生产线所需的契约设计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-生成任务的契约\">核心概念：生成任务的契约</h2><p>一个生成任务的最小完整定义包含五部分：<strong>输入</strong>（用哪个母版、哪套卖点、哪个市场渠道位置）、<strong>参数</strong>（模型、采样参数、尺寸）、<strong>幂等键</strong>（什么条件下视为同一个任务）、<strong>溯源</strong>（结果应该记录什么以便日后审计）、<strong>成本</strong>（这次调用花了多少）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  P[&quot;投放计划&lt;br/&gt;market×channel×placement&quot;] --&gt; EX[&quot;展开器&lt;br/&gt;expand()&quot;]&#10;  EX --&gt; T1[&quot;GenTask #1&lt;br/&gt;copy/zh-CN&quot;]&#10;  EX --&gt; T2[&quot;GenTask #2&lt;br/&gt;copy/ja-JP&quot;]&#10;  EX --&gt; T3[&quot;GenTask #3&lt;br/&gt;image/9:16&quot;]&#10;  T1 --&gt; Q[&quot;生成队列&lt;br/&gt;按优先级&quot;]&#10;  T2 --&gt; Q&#10;  T3 --&gt; Q&#10;  Q --&gt; W[&quot;Worker&lt;br/&gt;幂等 key 去重&quot;]&#10;  W --&gt; M1[&quot;文本模型&quot;]&#10;  W --&gt; M2[&quot;图像模型&quot;]&#10;  M1 --&gt; A[&quot;产出落库&lt;br/&gt;含 model/prompt/seed&quot;]&#10;  M2 --&gt; A&#10;  A --&gt; RV[&quot;人工审校队列&quot;]\">graph TD\n  P[\"投放计划&lt;br/&gt;market×channel×placement\"] --&gt; EX[\"展开器&lt;br/&gt;expand()\"]\n  EX --&gt; T1[\"GenTask #1&lt;br/&gt;copy/zh-CN\"]\n  EX --&gt; T2[\"GenTask #2&lt;br/&gt;copy/ja-JP\"]\n  EX --&gt; T3[\"GenTask #3&lt;br/&gt;image/9:16\"]\n  T1 --&gt; Q[\"生成队列&lt;br/&gt;按优先级\"]\n  T2 --&gt; Q\n  T3 --&gt; Q\n  Q --&gt; W[\"Worker&lt;br/&gt;幂等 key 去重\"]\n  W --&gt; M1[\"文本模型\"]\n  W --&gt; M2[\"图像模型\"]\n  M1 --&gt; A[\"产出落库&lt;br/&gt;含 model/prompt/seed\"]\n  M2 --&gt; A\n  A --&gt; RV[\"人工审校队列\"]</pre><p>展开器是纯函数：给定投放计划与素材库的候选集，输出一批 <code>GenTask</code>。它是纯函数这一点很重要——两次展开同一份计划必须得到同一批任务，否则重试会产生重复生成。</p>\n<p>五部分契约各自的失败后果说明了为什么它们都不能省：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>契约部分</th>\n<th>缺失时的具体故障</th>\n<th>影响范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>输入（母版/卖点/位置）</td>\n<td>生成结果无法确定来源，无法复现</td>\n<td>单任务不可诊断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>参数（模型/采样/尺寸）</td>\n<td>抽样与尺寸不同导致结果不可复现</td>\n<td>全批次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>幂等键</td>\n<td>重试产生重复计费与重复产出</td>\n<td>每次重试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>溯源（模型/模板/种子/提示词）</td>\n<td>无法回答&quot;为什么这张图是这样&quot;，无法追责</td>\n<td>全部历史产出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本</td>\n<td>无法判断某批次是否值得继续扩产</td>\n<td>预算与决策</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"幂等键的设计\">幂等键的设计</h3><p>幂等键必须覆盖所有会影响输出的输入，并且<strong>不包含</strong>任何会自然变化的东西（如时间戳、请求 ID）。一个可行的构造是：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"idempotency_key = sha256(&#10;  task_type || asset_id || version_id || locale || placement ||&#10;  prompt_template_id || prompt_template_version || model_id ||&#10;  sampling_params_canonical || input_digest&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>idempotency_key = sha256(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  task_type || asset_id || version_id || locale || placement ||</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  prompt_template_id || prompt_template_version || model_id ||</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  sampling_params_canonical || input_digest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这里有两个容易出错的点。第一，<code>prompt_template_version</code> 必须进键——同一个模板 ID 的内容被修改后，应该产生新任务而不是命中旧结果，否则运营改了模板却发现生成的还是老文案。第二，<code>sampling_params_canonical</code> 要做规范化（键排序、浮点定精度），否则 <code>{&quot;temperature&quot;:0.7,&quot;top_p&quot;:0.9}</code> 与 <code>{&quot;top_p&quot;:0.9,&quot;temperature&quot;:0.70000001}</code> 会算出不同的键。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE generation_task (&#10;  task_id          bigserial PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  idempotency_key  text NOT NULL,&#10;  task_type        text NOT NULL CHECK (task_type IN (&#39;copy&#39;,&#39;image&#39;,&#39;video&#39;,&#39;localize&#39;)),&#10;  asset_id         bigint,&#10;  source_version_id bigint,&#10;  locale           text NOT NULL,&#10;  placement        text NOT NULL,&#10;  market           text NOT NULL,&#10;  template_id      text NOT NULL,&#10;  template_version int  NOT NULL,&#10;  model_id         text NOT NULL,&#10;  params           jsonb NOT NULL,&#10;  status           text NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;queued&#39;&#10;                     CHECK (status IN (&#39;queued&#39;,&#39;running&#39;,&#39;succeeded&#39;,&#39;failed&#39;,&#39;canceled&#39;)),&#10;  attempt          int  NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  max_attempts     int  NOT NULL DEFAULT 3,&#10;  result_ref       text,&#10;  error_class      text,&#10;  cost_micros      bigint,&#10;  created_at       timestamptz NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  finished_at      timestamptz,&#10;  UNIQUE (idempotency_key)&#10;);&#10;CREATE INDEX gen_task_pending ON generation_task (status, created_at)&#10;  WHERE status IN (&#39;queued&#39;,&#39;running&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> generation_task</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  task_id          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigserial</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  idempotency_key  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  task_type        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (task_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'copy'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'image'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'video'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'localize'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  asset_id         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source_version_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  locale           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  placement        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  market           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  template_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  template_version </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  model_id         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  params           jsonb </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'queued'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                     CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'queued'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'running'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'succeeded'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'failed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'canceled'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  attempt          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  max_attempts     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  result_ref       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  error_class      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cost_micros      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  finished_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (idempotency_key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> gen_task_pending</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> generation_task (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, created_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'queued'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'running'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>唯一约束是幂等的实现——重复提交同一个键会命中冲突，此时应该返回已存在的任务而不是报错。<code>cost_micros</code> 用整数微单位记账避免浮点累积误差，第 4 章的 <a href=\"../creative-performance-loop/creative-cost-scale-metric\">创意生产成本与规模化指标</a> 会基于这一列做汇总。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三个必要索引与它们的查询\">三个必要索引与它们的查询</h3><p>任务表支撑三类查询，索引必须与它们对齐：取待办任务（worker 拉活）、按幂等键查重（重复提交）、按素材查历史（排查某素材生成过什么）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>查询</th>\n<th>WHERE / ORDER BY</th>\n<th>支撑索引</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Worker 拉活</td>\n<td><code>status IN (&#39;queued&#39;,&#39;running&#39;) ORDER BY created_at</code></td>\n<td><code>(status, created_at) WHERE status IN (...)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>幂等查重</td>\n<td><code>idempotency_key = ?</code></td>\n<td><code>UNIQUE (idempotency_key)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>素材历史</td>\n<td><code>asset_id = ? ORDER BY created_at DESC</code></td>\n<td><code>(asset_id, created_at DESC)</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Worker 拉活查询必须走部分索引而不是全表扫描，因为 <code>succeeded</code> 的任务会持续累积并最终占据绝大多数行。部分索引把索引体积压到只覆盖活跃任务，与 <a href=\"../creative-dam-model/asset-version-rights-license\">版本/版权/授权有效期管理</a> 里 <code>rights_active_expiry</code> 的部分索引是同一手法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"批量生成的调度\">批量生成的调度</h2><h3 id=\"并发与配额\">并发与配额</h3><p>模型服务有两类限制：并发连接数与每分钟请求数（RPM）。批量生成的任务量远大于这两者，所以本地必须有一个节流器。朴素的做法是用一个固定大小的 worker 池，问题是当一个模型变慢时整个池被慢任务占满，其它模型的吞吐被拖垮。</p>\n<p>更好的做法是<strong>按模型分池 + 令牌桶</strong>：每个模型一个独立队列与一个独立令牌桶，桶的容量与补充速率来自该模型的配额配置。这样一个模型被限流不会影响其它模型。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;pools&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;model_id&quot;: &quot;text-gen-large&quot;,&#10;      &quot;concurrency&quot;: 8,&#10;      &quot;rpm&quot;: 600,&#10;      &quot;burst&quot;: 60,&#10;      &quot;timeout_ms&quot;: 45000,&#10;      &quot;retry&quot;: { &quot;max&quot;: 3, &quot;backoff&quot;: &quot;exp-jitter&quot;, &quot;base_ms&quot;: 800 }&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;model_id&quot;: &quot;image-gen-xl&quot;,&#10;      &quot;concurrency&quot;: 4,&#10;      &quot;rpm&quot;: 120,&#10;      &quot;burst&quot;: 12,&#10;      &quot;timeout_ms&quot;: 180000,&#10;      &quot;retry&quot;: { &quot;max&quot;: 2, &quot;backoff&quot;: &quot;exp-jitter&quot;, &quot;base_ms&quot;: 2000 }&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;model_id&quot;: &quot;video-gen-clip&quot;,&#10;      &quot;concurrency&quot;: 2,&#10;      &quot;rpm&quot;: 20,&#10;      &quot;burst&quot;: 4,&#10;      &quot;timeout_ms&quot;: 900000,&#10;      &quot;retry&quot;: { &quot;max&quot;: 1, &quot;backoff&quot;: &quot;fixed&quot;, &quot;base_ms&quot;: 10000 }&#10;    }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;global&quot;: { &quot;maxInflightCostMicros&quot;: 50000000, &quot;drainOnShutdownMs&quot;: 30000 }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"pools\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"model_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"text-gen-large\"</span><span style=\"c