an class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"timeout_ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">900000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"retry\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"backoff\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"fixed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"base_ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"global\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"maxInflightCostMicros\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50000000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"drainOnShutdownMs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>maxInflightCostMicros</code> 是一个成本熔断：当在途任务的预估总成本超过阈值时停止取新任务。这是防止异常展开（比如一次计划错误地展开成十万个任务）烧掉整月预算的最后一道闸。</p>\n<h3 id=\"退避与抖动\">退避与抖动</h3><p>重试的退避必须带抖动，否则所有失败任务会在同一时刻重试形成二次冲击。指数退避的标准形式是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{n} = \\min\\left(t_{max},\\ b \\cdot 2^{n-1}\\right) \\cdot U(1 - j,\\ 1 + j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2141em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 是基础延迟，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 是第几次重试，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 是均匀分布采样，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 是抖动比例（实践中取 0.1 到 0.5）。没有抖动时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个同时失败的任务会在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b \\cdot 2^{n-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时刻同时重试，峰值与失败规模成正比。</p>\n<h3 id=\"失败分类决定重试策略\">失败分类决定重试策略</h3><p>不是所有失败都值得重试。把失败分成三类，重试策略完全不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>失败类别</th>\n<th>典型原因</th>\n<th>是否重试</th>\n<th>处理方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>瞬时</td>\n<td>超时、连接重置、429 限流</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>指数退避重试，429 尊重 Retry-After</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>永久</td>\n<td>参数非法、提示词触发内容过滤</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>立即置 failed，进人工处置队列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不确定</td>\n<td>连接中断在响应返回后、网关 5xx 无响应体</td>\n<td>有条件</td>\n<td>先用幂等键查询是否已产生结果，再决定是否重投</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三类是分布式系统里最容易写错的。一个超时不代表没有发生——模型可能已经生成完成，只是响应没回到客户端。若此时直接重投，会产生重复计费与重复产出。正确做法是<strong>先对账再重投</strong>：查询生成服务是否已有该幂等键对应的结果，有则收下，无则重投。</p>\n<h2 id=\"生成物的落库与溯源\">生成物的落库与溯源</h2><p>生成结果不能只存一个文件路径。一次生成需要记录的溯源信息包括：用的哪个模型与版本、提示词原文与模板版本、随机种子、采样参数、输入母版的版本 ID、生成时刻。这些字段让三个日后的问题变得可回答：为什么这张图风格不对（追溯模板与模型）、能否复现同一张图（种子与参数）、这次侵权风险来自哪个输入（母版血缘）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;task_id&quot;: 8814217,&#10;  &quot;result_ref&quot;: &quot;dam://gen/2026/09/28/8814217.png&quot;,&#10;  &quot;provenance&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;model_id&quot;: &quot;image-gen-xl&quot;,&#10;    &quot;model_revision&quot;: &quot;2026-07-11&quot;,&#10;    &quot;template_id&quot;: &quot;tpl-product-hero&quot;,&#10;    &quot;template_version&quot;: 7,&#10;    &quot;prompt_rendered&quot;: &quot;studio shot of &lt;product&gt; on gradient background, brand color #1B4FD8, no text&quot;,&#10;    &quot;seed&quot;: 4410992331,&#10;    &quot;sampling&quot;: { &quot;steps&quot;: 30, &quot;guidance&quot;: 7.5, &quot;width&quot;: 1080, &quot;height&quot;: 1920 },&#10;    &quot;source_version_id&quot;: 55120&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;content_source_type&quot;: &quot;trainedAlgorithmicMedia&quot;,&#10;  &quot;usage&quot;: { &quot;input_tokens&quot;: 0, &quot;output_tokens&quot;: 0, &quot;images&quot;: 1, &quot;cost_micros&quot;: 32000 }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"task_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8814217</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"result_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dam://gen/2026/09/28/8814217.png\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"provenance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"model_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"image-gen-xl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"model_revision\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-07-11\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"template_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tpl-product-hero\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"template_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"prompt_rendered\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"studio shot of &#x3C;product> on gradient background, brand color #1B4FD8, no text\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"seed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4410992331</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"sampling\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"steps\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"guidance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"width\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1080</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"height\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1920</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"source_version_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">55120</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"content_source_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"trainedAlgorithmicMedia\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"usage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"input_tokens\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"output_tokens\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"images\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"cost_micros\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>content_source_type</code> 的取值来自 IPTC 的受控词表：<code>trainedAlgorithmicMedia</code> 表示用训练于既有内容之上的 AI 模型生成，<code>compositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMedia</code> 表示对既有图像做生成式编辑（如 inpaint/outpaint），<code>algorithmicMedia</code> 表示不基于采样训练的纯算法生成 <a href=\"https://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/digitalsourcetype/\">IPTC Digital Source Type</a>。区分这三者不是学术洁癖——它决定了下游必须披露什么、以及在哪些市场需要额外标记。</p>\n<h3 id=\"内容凭证\">内容凭证</h3><p>对需要对外证明来源的素材，生成环节应当同时产出内容凭证。C2PA 规范定义了这套机制：一次签名的 claim 引用若干 assertion（其中 <code>c2pa.actions</code> 记录对素材执行过的操作，<code>c2pa.hash.data</code> 之类的硬绑定用密码学哈希把 manifest 与素材字节绑定），claim、assertion 与签名合成一个 manifest，即面向用户的&quot;Content Credential&quot; <a href=\"https://spec.c2pa.org/specifications/specifications/2.1/specs/C2PA_Specification.html\">C2PA Specification 2.1</a>。验证时校验签名与证书链、重算硬绑定哈希，并递归验证 ingredient 的凭证。</p>\n<p>工程上的落点是：AI 生成的素材在写入素材库时，除了自身的 provenance 字段，还要写一份 C2PA manifest，把生成操作记为 <code>c2pa.actions</code> 中的一条，并把源母版作为 ingredient 引用。这样素材无论被导出到哪个平台，来源链都跟着文件走。注意 C2PA 2.0 起移除了早期版本中的 &quot;Training &amp; Data Mining&quot; assertion，且 2.x 只允许 X.509 证书签名——如果依赖的是旧版实现，升级时需要重新评估签名链路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"视频生成的额外约束\">视频生成的额外约束</h2><p>视频与文案、图片的差别在于代价量级。一条 6 秒短视频的生成时间可能是图片的两个数量级，这使得&quot;批量生成全部变体，再挑好的&quot;策略在经济上不成立。可行的策略是<strong>两阶段</strong>：先用低成本方式（图片模型生成关键帧、或文案模型生成分镜脚本）产生大量候选，人工或模型筛选后只对通过的少数做视频生成。</p>\n<p>这个策略对数据模型的要求是：视频生成任务必须能引用&quot;已通过的关键帧/分镜&quot;作为输入，而不是从零开始。因此 <code>generation_task.source_version_id</code> 在视频任务里指向的是一个已经审校通过的中间产物版本，而不是原始母版。这也让视频生成的成本分摊变得清晰——失败的分镜筛选成本记在筛选环节，视频生成成本只记在真正出片的那些任务上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>生成的输入、参数、幂等键、溯源、成本五者构成任务契约，缺任一项都无法规模化。</li>\n<li>幂等键必须覆盖模板版本与规范化的采样参数，且不含时间戳这类自然变化的值。</li>\n<li>按模型分池加令牌桶；成本熔断防止异常展开烧掉预算。</li>\n<li>指数退避必须带抖动，否则失败任务会二次冲击。</li>\n<li>失败分瞬时/永久/不确定三类；不确定的必须先对账再重投，因为超时不等于没发生。</li>\n<li>溯源记录模型版本、模板版本、提示词原文、种子与参数，让复现与追责可回答。</li>\n<li>用 IPTC Digital Source Type 标注生成方式，用 C2PA manifest 承载可分发的来源凭证。</li>\n<li>视频生成走两阶段策略，成本只记在真正出片的任务上。</li>\n<li>生成物的审校见 <a href=\"human-review-brand-guard\">人工审校与品牌一致性</a>；落库目标表见 <a href=\"../creative-dam-model/creative-asset-library-tag\">素材库模型与多维标签</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"AI 文案/图/视频批量生成","id":"ai-文案-图-视频批量生成"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：生成任务的契约","id":"核心概念-生成任务的契约"},{"level":3,"text":"幂等键的设计","id":"幂等键的设计"},{"level":3,"text":"三个必要索引与它们的查询","id":"三个必要索引与它们的查询"},{"level":2,"text":"批量生成的调度","id":"批量生成的调度"},{"level":3,"text":"并发与配额","id":"并发与配额"},{"level":3,"text":"退避与抖动","id":"退避与抖动"},{"level":3,"text":"失败分类决定重试策略","id":"失败分类决定重试策略"},{"level":2,"text":"生成物的落库与溯源","id":"生成物的落库与溯源"},{"level":3,"text":"内容凭证","id":"内容凭证"},{"level":2,"text":"视频生成的额外约束","id":"视频生成的额外约束"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"按市场×渠道的素材复用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-creative-dam-aigc-production/creative-dam-model/market-channel-asset-reuse"},"next":{"title":"本地化创意变体生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-creative-dam-aigc-production/aigc-creative-production/creative-variant-localize"}}